{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Final Passage is a first-person psychological horror game set in a storm-wrecked coastal village. Navigate flooded ruins, manipulate physics-based debris, and survive attacks from the drowned dead as you make your way towards the last lighthouse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Stranded at Sea</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake in a rowboat, drifting through a ship graveyard in the middle of a storm. Your only landmark is the bright beam of a lighthouse in the distance.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Row through violent waters while thunder cracks overhead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your lantern to navigate\u2014but its fuel is limited</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weather shifts as you make your way through the storm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No map, no markers, just you and your lantern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603520/extras/FinalPassageGifs00000446-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744347240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Drowning Village</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The remains of a flooded hamlet lay inland from the shore. Walkways collapse, water laps at your feet, and things don\u2019t stay the same as you left them.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve environmental challenges to progress through the floodwaters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stave off the hallucinations of the village's previous inhabitants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stack crates and debris to reach higher ground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore basements, corridors, and homes lost to the sea</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603520/extras/FinalPassageGifs00000000-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744347240\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Last Beacon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The lighthouse still towers above the ruins. Weather-beaten, gutted, but somehow still running.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight your way through the drowned dead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find notes and defenses left behind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your way to the top of the last lighthouse</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603520/extras/ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744347240\" /> </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603520?t=1744347240","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603520/7fedaca8220cfd60e7b3c384cda7236af8acdad8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744347240","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603520/6c300f3899e08e42e30a2ee60d8e49a8c4831c5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744347240","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603520/6c300f3899e08e42e30a2ee60d8e49a8c4831c5f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744347240","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Final Passage contains violence against monster enemies and some gore."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Final Passage is a first-person psychological horror game set in a storm-wrecked coastal village. Navigate flooded ruins, manipulate physics-based debris, and survive attacks from the drowned dead as you make your way towards the last lighthouse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><